#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.atomic_cas.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.atomic\\_cas"
msgstr "cuda.tile.atomic\\_cas"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_cas:1 of
msgid "Bulk atomic compare-and-swap on array elements with given indices."
msgstr "对指定索引处的数组元素执行批量原子比较并交换（CAS）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_cas:3 of
msgid ""
"For each specified index, `atomic_cas()` compares the corresponding array"
" element to the `expected` value. If it matches, it is then overwritten "
"with the `desired` value; otherwise, no update is performed. In either "
"case, the old value of the element is returned. For each individual "
"element, the described compare-and-swap operation is performed "
"atomically, but the operation as a whole is not atomic, and the order of "
"individual updates is unspecified."
msgstr ""
"对于每个指定索引， ``atomic_cas()`` 会将对应的数组元素与 ``expected`` 值进行比较。若相等，则将其覆盖为 "
"``desired`` "
"值；否则不执行更新。无论哪种情况，均会返回该元素的旧值。对于单个元素而言，上述比较并交换操作是原子执行的，但整体操作并不具备跨元素原子性，且各个元素的更新顺序未指定。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_cas:9 of
msgid ""
"`atomic_cas()` follows the same convention as :py:func:`gather()` and "
":py:func:`scatter()`: `indices` must be a tuple whose length equals the "
"`array` rank. All elements of this tuple must be integer tiles or scalars"
" of the same shape, or different shapes that are broadcastable to a "
"common shape. If the array is 1-dimensional, `indices` can be passed as a"
" single tile rather than a tuple of length 1."
msgstr ""
"``atomic_cas()`` 遵循与 :py:func:`gather()` 和 :py:func:`scatter()` 相同的约定： "
"``indices`` 必须为长度等于 ``array`` "
"秩（rank）的元组。该元组的所有元素都必须是具有相同形状（或可广播到同一公共形状的）整数 Tile 或标量。若数组为一维， "
"``indices`` 可直接作为单个 Tile 传入，而无需包装为长度为 1 的元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_cas:16 of
msgid ""
"`expected` and `desired` must be scalars or tiles whose shapes are "
"broadcastable to the common shape of `indices`."
msgstr "``expected`` 和 ``desired`` 必须为标量或 Tile，其形状需可广播到 ``indices`` 的公共形状。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_cas:19 of
msgid ""
"By default, `atomic_cas()` checks that indices are within the bounds of "
"the array. For indices that are out of bounds, no operation is performed,"
" and a corresponding `expected` value is returned. To disable bounds "
"checking, set `check_bounds` to ``False``. In this mode, the caller is "
"responsible for ensuring that all indices are within the bounds of the "
"array, and any out-of-bounds access will result in undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下， ``atomic_cas()`` 会检查索引是否在数组边界内。对于越界索引，不会执行任何操作，并返回对应的 ``expected``"
" 值。若要禁用边界检查，请将 ``check_bounds`` 设为 ``False`` "
"。在此模式下，调用方须负责确保所有索引均在数组边界内，任何越界访问都将导致未定义行为。"

